* A function to allow early investors to purchase tokens at a discounted rate (e.g., 1 ETH = 1000 tokens at presale vs. 1 ETH = 800 tokens in the main contract).
* A mechanism to track the number of tokens sold during the presale.
* A function to allow the project team to set a maximum cap for the presale (e.g., a maximum of 20% of the total token supply can be sold during the presale).
