//
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In the modern era, jazz has continued to evolve and diversify. The 1980s and 1990s saw the rise of smooth jazz and the resurgence of traditional New Orleans jazz. The 21st century has seen a fusion of jazz with electronic and hip-hop elements, as well as a growing interest in avant-garde and experimental jazz.

